OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers soon
OL,6,Fdying out, otherwise a dry evening
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells. Skies becoming
OL,8,Fmostly clear overnight in the east but
OL,9,Fcloudier with the odd shower in the
OL,10,Fwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,13,Fwith the best of the sunny spells in
OL,14,Fthe east. Cloudier across the north
OL,15,Fand west with a few light showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
