OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and scattered light showers on
OL,7,FSunday. Dry with long sunny spells on
OL,8,FMonday and becoming a little warmer.
OL,9,FOutbreaks of rain spread north on
OL,10,FTuesday.
